<Layout title="Paladugu Ganesh Naidu | AI Systems & GenAI Engineer" description="AI systems, local LLMs, RAG, developer tools and research by Paladugu Ganesh Naidu. Explore LOMVREN, projects and the AI engineering roadmap." wide><section class="wrap home-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> AI ENGINEER · BUILDER · EXPLORER</div><h1>Thoughtful code.<br/><em>Intelligent</em><br/>possibilities.</h1><p class="lead">I’m Ganesh Naidu. I build useful AI systems — from local models and agents to the infrastructure that brings them to life.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button dark" href="/work/">Explore my work <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/resume/">View resume ↗</a></div><div class="hero-signature"><img src="/images/profile/ganesh-naidu.jpg" alt="Paladugu Ganesh Naidu" width="48" height="48"/><div><strong>Paladugu Ganesh Naidu</strong><span>GenAI · full-stack · security</span></div></div></div><Scene/></section><div class="wrap capabilities"><span>Ideas into working systems</span><span>RAG & local LLMs</span><span>Agent workflows</span><span>GPU inference</span><span>Security-aware design</span></div><section class="wrap section product-feature" data-reveal><div class="product-copy"><div class="eyebrow">01 / THE PRODUCT I’M BUILDING</div><span class="product-wordmark">LOMVREN<span>✳</span></span><h2>Your models.<br/>Your engineering environment.</h2><p>A local-first coding assistant inside VS Code. Ask questions, create plans, review changes, and connect to your own remote GPU over SSH.</p><a href="/lomvren/" class="button">Meet LOMVREN ↗</a><a class="text-link marketplace-link" href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=paladuguganeshnaidu.localforge-vscode">Get the VS Code extension ↗</a><p class="small">Formerly LocalForge · Open-source development</p></div><div class="ide-preview" aria-label="Illustration of the LOMVREN workflow"><div class="ide-bar"><span>● ● ●</span><span>LOMVREN / workspace</span><span>⌘</span></div><div class="ide-modes"><span>Ask</span><span>Plan</span><strong>Agent</strong><i>LOCAL OLLAMA ●</i></div><div class="ide-message">Build something useful.<span>Understand the code. Make a plan. Review the change.</span></div><div class="ide-task"><span>✓</span><div>Inspect the workspace<small>Context before code</small></div></div><div class="ide-task"><span>✓</span><div>Prepare a reviewed proposal<small>Multi-file changes · snapshot checks</small></div></div><div class="ide-diff"><span>+ a clearer path from idea to implementation</span><span>+ validation after approved edits</span></div><div class="ide-input">What would you like to build?<span>↑</span></div><p class="small">Workflow illustration · see repository for actual interface</p></div></section><section class="wrap section" id="selected-work"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / SELECTED WORK</div><h2>A few things<br/><em>I’ve put into the world.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/work/">All projects ↗</a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.map(([n,title,desc,slug,color,tag])=><a class:list={['project-tile',color]} href={'https://github.com/paladuguganeshnaidu/'+slug} data-reveal><div class="tile-top"><span>{n} / {tag}</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="tile-art" aria-hidden="true">{n==='01'?<div class="rag-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>↗</b><span>answer</span></div>:n==='02'?<div class="chart-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>:n==='03'?<div class="land-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>:<div class="scan-art"><i></i><span>◎</span></div>}</div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></a>)}</div></section><section class="infrastructure section" id="infrastructure"><div class="wrap infra-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / FROM MODEL TO SYSTEM</div><h2>The useful part<br/><em>is how it all connects.</em></h2><p class="lead">Data becomes context. Context reaches a model. Tools turn an answer into action. Evaluation closes the loop.</p><div class="infra-steps">{[['01','Ground it','Documents, embeddings and vector search.'],['02','Run it','Local inference, GPU compute and model serving.'],['03','Connect it','FastAPI, tools, agents and MCP.'],['04','Measure it','Quality, latency, memory and reproducibility.']].map(([n,title,desc])=><article data-infra-step><span>{n}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></div></article>)}</div></div><div class="infra-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stack-plate p1">APPS & AGENTS <span>LOMVREN / MCP</span></div><div class="stack-plate p2">CONTEXT & RETRIEVAL <span>RAG / VECTOR DB</span></div><div class="stack-plate p3">INFERENCE & SERVING <span>OLLAMA / FASTAPI</span></div><div class="stack-plate p4"><img src="/images/hardware/dgx-stack.svg" alt=""/>GPU COMPUTE <span>NVIDIA DGX SPARK</span></div><div class="infra-orbit"></div></div></div><div class="wrap small hardware-credit">Original hardware imagery: <a href="https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/products/workstations/dgx-spark/">NVIDIA DGX Spark</a>. Visual references to compute infrastructure; no affiliation implied.</div></section><section class="wrap section roadmap-feature" data-reveal><div><div class="eyebrow">04 / LEARNING IN PUBLIC</div><h2>Always building.<br/><em>Always becoming.</em></h2><p>A dependency-based roadmap from neural network foundations to production GenAI systems. Every concept earns its place through a working project.</p><a class="button dark" href="/roadmap/">Explore the roadmap ↗</a></div><div class="roadmap-mini"><span>FOUNDATIONS <b>✓</b></span><span>NEURAL NETWORKS <b>✓</b></span><span class="current">ACTIVATION FUNCTIONS <b>↗</b></span><span>PYTORCH → TRANSFORMERS</span><span>RAG → AGENTS → PRODUCTION</span></div></section></Layout>